>> Digital's OSF is very buggy and unstable.

Nothing could be further from the truth.

I have two workstations on my desk, one is a HP 710 running HP-UX V8.0.7 and
the other is a DECstation 3100 running DEC OSF/1 V1.0. I use my
DECstation 99% of the time because I find it a better working environment.
During the year that I have been running OSF I have had no system crashes and
I have come across very few problems (bugs).

I must stress that I am using V1.0 and V1.2, which will be the version
on Alpha, is even better.

I suggest you ask your Digital rep for a chance to pop in and use an
Alpha with OSF or if you have a free DECstation then have a think about
loading DEC OSF/1 V1.0 and see for yourself.


Stephen.

