individuals drop 4.4 onto an Alpha and we get a performance comparison
between the two systems on that box. Dropping 4.4 onto an Alpha might
not be too bad, as 4.4 and OSF share almost the same VM architecture and one 
could see how device drivers might not need too much hacking.

